{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52651","headline":"同前 · □冯","name":"同前","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）芳（下缺）□□游□浦，弄鸟戏兰陔。\n石□吟□□，山□奏落梅。\n寿□半□□，□□□□□。\n□□临江酌，舞席倚泉开。\n□留□□□，□醉□岩□。\n（同前）（按：冯□原、□冯，皆署爲黄土县令，疑爲前後任。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"□冯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}